    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8334" root="حضن" body-key="H">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احضن الطَّائِرَ البَيْضَ</span></b>  <i>He made the bird to
sit</i> [or <i>brood</i>] <i>upon the eggs.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْضَنَهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهُ</span>: see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احضن بِحَقِّى</span> (tropical:)  <i>He went away
with,</i> or <i>took away, my right,</i> or <i>due;</i> (K, TA;)
as though he put it by his side. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احضن</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّجُلَ</span>, (AZ, S, K, *) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احضن بِهِ</span>, (K,) <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْرَى بِهِ</span> (assumed tropical:)  [<i>He held him in little,</i> or <i>light,</i> or
<i>mean, estimation,</i> or <i>in contempt;</i> &amp;c.]. (AZ,
S, K.)

